/S /H1
/P 298 0 R
/T (Both models shared a fundamental limitation: neither could scale at speed. A district hospital psychiatrist could serve only those who attended the facility. An independent practitioner was bounded by the hours in a working day and the reach of a single location.)
/E (Both models shared a fundamental limitation: neither could scale at speed. A district hospital psychiatrist could serve only those who attended the facility. An independent practitioner was bounded by the hours in a working day and the reach of a single location.)
/Pg 30 0 R
