/T (The longer-term risk is quality. If the apprenticeship pipeline producing legal quality is hollowed out by gig-ification, current cost savings may generate quality deficits not priced into platform transactions. A cheaper contract review may also be a less reliable one, a trade-off clients currently lack the information to assess.)
