/P 312 0 R
/T (Currently, compliance work, monthly and annual return filing, data collation, takes significant human effort. AI is already streamlining this. The concern is that as businesses adopt AI-powered tools for compliance themselves, they may stop outsourcing to law firms or CA firms altogether, severely impacting employment in the compliance segment.)
/E (Currently, compliance work, monthly and annual return filing, data collation, takes significant human effort. AI is already streamlining this. The concern is that as businesses adopt AI-powered tools for compliance themselves, they may stop outsourcing to law firms or CA firms altogether, severely impacting employment in the compliance segment.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [11]
>>
